	<section_number>2.2-3307</section_number>
	<catch_line>Dogwood Day</catch_line>
	<text>
		The third Saturday in April of each year shall be known and designated as "Dogwood Day."
	</text>
	<history>1952, c. 111, § 2-22.1; 1966, c. 677, § 2.1-26; 2001, c. 844.</history>
